                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b13ece07-e183-38c8-b884-c46d1288d55a",
                        "entry_id": "081b88c4-cf9c-31ed-9fe9-d275869fb0cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. скругление внутренних и внешних углов на деталях машин, в литейных формах и т. п.; увеличивает прочность детали"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "63c8ad16-af32-42a6-a8c3-fb1ce5bbab96",
                                "sense_id": "b13ece07-e183-38c8-b884-c46d1288d55a",
                                "text": "На переходных галтелях между дном и крутой стенкой штампа сопротивление инструменту возрастает в несколько раз по сравнению с сопротивлением на прямолинейных участках."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db6aac43-f21d-3437-a4e0-9ab1c11cafdd",
                        "entry_id": "081b88c4-cf9c-31ed-9fe9-d275869fb0cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "выструганный полукруглый желобок, выемка"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "799b2dec-dbd4-3fd3-b581-3d4e8b4ec8d1",
                        "entry_id": "081b88c4-cf9c-31ed-9fe9-d275869fb0cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "узкая декоративная планка, прикрывающая щели в стыках соединений"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d62de66c-e46b-44c5-acc3-427fc73d6549",
                                "sense_id": "799b2dec-dbd4-3fd3-b581-3d4e8b4ec8d1",
                                "text": "Здесь целый набор профилей ― плинтусов, наличников, накладок, галтелей, крышек и блоков с розетками и выключателями, ― изготовленных из пластмассы, трудно поддающейся возгоранию."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "532ac9e5-df2c-430e-b83e-8ba74ee6f1bd",
                                "sense_id": "799b2dec-dbd4-3fd3-b581-3d4e8b4ec8d1",
                                "text": "На полу, ощетинясь гвоздями, валялась отлетевшая от удара галтель."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c825b61-ce66-3afb-912d-e49e0d600cf8",
                        "entry_id": "081b88c4-cf9c-31ed-9fe9-d275869fb0cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "столярный рубанок для выстругивания на брусках желобков (выкружек), фигурных профилей (калевок)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b1c044a-24f3-4d7f-a43b-1f3f829e8978",
                        "source_entry_id": "081b88c4-cf9c-31ed-9fe9-d275869fb0cb",
                        "source_sense_description": "скругление углов",
                        "target_lang_word": "fillet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fillet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c302460-da69-3ee2-9ad9-9288d9ce29b7",
                                        "entry_id": "12ced969-d86a-32a1-a5fe-c550b7dda1f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A headband; a ribbon or other band used to tie the hair up, or keep a headdress in place, or for decoration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "600f5f1f-7f69-4804-a28a-52deb55a378e",
                                                "sense_id": "6c302460-da69-3ee2-9ad9-9288d9ce29b7",
                                                "text": "In secret shadow, farre from all mens sight:\n From her faire head her fillet she undight,\n And laid her stole aside."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "596b4b4a-7449-48db-bf77-7611ec8c2423",
                                                "sense_id": "6c302460-da69-3ee2-9ad9-9288d9ce29b7",
                                                "text": "A fillet binds her hair."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e45ee4cc-13e4-42ca-9154-053298306c44",
                                                "sense_id": "6c302460-da69-3ee2-9ad9-9288d9ce29b7",
                                                "text": "\"Know thy own worth, and reverence the lyre,\" is a line that should be as a fillet bound round the brow—a philactory embroidered on the garments of every son and daughter of Adam distinguished by the possession of that sacred gift, which, whether used or abused, applauded in itself or derided in its possessor, is the highest and the most inalienable distinction humanity ever has or ever can be gifted with, whether bestowed on the highest or the humblest being, in the great mass to which we all belong."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ae0b175-b038-4332-9bd4-7b8ddb0414c9",
                                                "sense_id": "6c302460-da69-3ee2-9ad9-9288d9ce29b7",
                                                "text": "She was talking of Raymond Duncan, a walking absurdity who dressed in an ancient handwoven Greek costume and wore his hair in long braids reaching to his waist, adding, on ceremonial occasions, a fillet of bay-leaves."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d1409f2-8840-36ec-bf25-06c2fa2744dc",
                                        "entry_id": "12ced969-d86a-32a1-a5fe-c550b7dda1f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thin strip of any material, in various technical uses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bcc922e6-59c3-3b2a-b8dd-ac2a664081f5",
                                        "entry_id": "12ced969-d86a-32a1-a5fe-c550b7dda1f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A heavy bead of waterproofing compound or sealant material generally installed at the point where vertical and horizontal surfaces meet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8a5d826-6668-38d7-9bb4-4c8fe644d430",
                                        "entry_id": "12ced969-d86a-32a1-a5fe-c550b7dda1f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rounded relief or cut at an edge, especially an inside edge, added for a finished appearance and to break sharp edges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12099c1a-68a5-3e46-9d2a-5f82a8f45f3f",
                                        "entry_id": "12ced969-d86a-32a1-a5fe-c550b7dda1f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A strip or compact piece of meat or fish from which any bones and skin and feathers have been removed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fb7ed24-41a1-4338-8eae-5b0f6bc764df",
                                                "sense_id": "12099c1a-68a5-3e46-9d2a-5f82a8f45f3f",
                                                "text": "Fillet of a Fenny Snake, / In the Cauldron boyle and bake:"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b590ffe4-1c80-3efa-9d09-ea7f00d8aaf2",
                                        "entry_id": "12ced969-d86a-32a1-a5fe-c550b7dda1f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A premium cut of meat, especially beef, taken from below the lower back of the animal, considered to be lean and tender; also called tenderloin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
